OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy with occasional showers
OL,7,Fand one or two clear intervals through
OL,8,Fthe evening and overnight. The strong
OL,9,Fsoutheasterly winds will persist.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA cloudy day with outbreaks
OL,12,Fof rain, these showery over Shetland
OL,13,Fwith some drier spells but becoming
OL,14,Fmore persistent over Orkney. Winds
OL,15,Feasing slightly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
