OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBrighter on Thursday with sunshine and
OL,7,Fa few showers, though rain may return
OL,8,Fto Shetland for a time. Bright with
OL,9,Fscattered showers Friday and Saturday,
OL,10,Fchance of rain Friday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
